  "notes": [
    "Regular -ER verb — follows standard endings in every tense, no exceptions.",
    "Often used with business/journey contexts: *emprender un negocio* (\"to start a business\"), *emprender un viaje* (\"to embark on a trip\").",
    "*Ella decidió emprender su propio negocio.* (\"She decided to start her own business.\")",
    "*Emprendimos el viaje al amanecer.* (\"We set off on the trip at dawn.\")",
    "Related: *el emprendimiento* (entrepreneurship, noun), *el/la emprendedor(a)* (entrepreneur), *comenzar* (broader synonym, \"to begin\")."
  ],
